# D credentials are process environment values; launch Visual Studio from that private environment.
# Prefer Swagger Authorize for clipboard scripts. Never commit actual credentials.
### Missing token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments

### Invalid token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer intentionally-invalid

### Valid Courier: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv APEXPOST_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Courier cannot DELETE: 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-12345678
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv APEXPOST_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Admin cannot PATCH: 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-12345678/status
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv APEXPOST_ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PickedUp"}

### Wrong courier: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-12345678/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv APEXPOST_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"id":"scan::aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa","trackingNumber":"APX-12345678","scanType":"Pickup","courierId":"OTHER","location":"Demo","scannedAtUtc":"2020-01-01T10:00:00Z","notes":"Fictional"}]

### Missing key: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-12345678

### Invalid key: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-12345678
X-Api-Key: intentionally-invalid

### Configured key: 200 (create shipment first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-12345678
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv APEXPOST_PARTNER_KEY}}
